window.products.push({"id":184236,"name":"AI LOVE PEACE Spice Box,Revolving Seasoning Spice Container, Spinning Salt Box, Kitchen Pantry Storage Countertop Stainless Steel Spice Boxes Storage ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fRRn+Eb8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"● ✅【PREMIUM & SAFE QUALITY】: Our revolving caddy is made out of the highest quality shatter-resistant food-grade plastic that is durable, BPA-free, non-toxic and odorless. This set includes 5 large removable divider containers which can be pulled out for easy refills. Each pull-out divider storage bin is high in capacity - measured at 3.50” (W) x 2.76” (H) with an overall rack dimension of 8.86” (D) x 5.83” (H). Designed to be reusable, this is a green living choice for you! ● ✅【EASY TO USE】: Designed akin to a lazy susan turntable that swivels 360°, it operates on an independent cylinder shaft roller for smooth spins and efficient access. The higher outer walls keep contents safe in place especially when the tray is spinning. The clear transparent plastic makes it easy to see for access and no-mess refills! Comes with a 4.45” (L) spoon that fits inside the bin, it ensures no cross-contamination. Easy to clean with just a damp cloth and no assembly needed! ● ✅【STORAGE SOLUTION】: Our revolving spice rack maximizes storage space with minimal space. Its compact design creates a small footprint and is perfect to fit into narrow spaces. The top handle is rounded which promotes comfortable and steady grip when carrying the caddy out from deep cabinets or upper shelves. The lid cover is airtight so to keep spices fresh for a long time. Its flat base ensures stability when spinning, avoiding spillage on your countertop. ● ✅【Sturdy & Durable 】: Made of high quality material(PP, PS), which makes them completely safe for storing food items. ● ✅【Components 】: 3 compartment condiment dispensers with 3 serving spoons and a non-slip tray to protect all seasoning box and the cover can be easily open and keep the spice dry. ● ✅【Multi-use 】: Can be used to hold a variety of condiments: salt, pepper, sugar, spice, corn starch and chicken broth powder and more ● ✅【Transparent Seasoning Box】: can easily distinguish variety of condiments in the seasoning box,easy for storage ● ✅【IDEAL GIFT SET】: Comes with 8 sheets of 6” x 10” sticker spice labels and a few empty ones for customization, you are not restricted by the labels anymore - just re-label! This gives flexibility to choose and rotate spices easily, anytime. The handle makes it easy to carry around the kitchen, for picnics or potlucks! Our rotating spice rack features a modern design outlook with sticker labels - makes a great housewarming gift or wedding registry list! ● ✅【SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】: We believe in offering value and hence we will ensure that every product we deliver out is of the highest quality. If for any reason you feel that our spice rack does not meet your expectations, do reach out to us and we will get things right for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fRRn+Eb8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AI LOVE PEACE","source_asin":"B08ZK8YWDH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZK8YWDH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZK8YWDH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":184237,"name":"Yifely Easy Install Blue Denim Pattern Moisture Proof Shelf Liner PVC Kitchen Cabinet Drawer Cover,45x600cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dhcddiyQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Instruction For Use:1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature.2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water.3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter.4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.This multi-purpose drawer paper can protect the furniture from humidity and dirt efficiently.A adorable furniture accessories for your daily home life.Wide:45cmLength: 6MPlease allow 3~7cm deviation as they are manual cutting. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLL with the toal length you ordered together in one parcel. But our other warehouse in England will send seperated roll. Please be noted.Material: PVCPackage Included: One RollNote:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface.4. Storage methods: stored at cool, dry and ventilated place. Because of PVC material, you can put it in a ventilated place to remove the vinyl smell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dhcddiyQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yifely","source_asin":"B016MY2USM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016MY2USM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016MY2USM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
