window.products.push({"id":184411,"name":"Tribesigns 18-Shelf Bookcase, Vintage Tree Bookshelf Book Rack Display Shelf Storage Organizer for CDs, Records, Books, Home Office Deco (Rustic Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k0fzPorhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【MULTIPLE USAGE & FIT FOR VARIOUS SPACE】 This tree shaped shelf can be used as a book case, storage shelf, room divider, flower rack in living room, bedroom, kids room, can be also used in the office for storage and display. Contemporary design allows it to easily complement your homes and office decor. 【18 TIERS SHELVES & ABUNDANT STORAGE SPACE】This display rack allows a large storage area for your multiple items, books, magazines, toys, photo frames, plants, and artworks. 【SECURE SIDE & BACK BOARD DESIGN】Side shelves prevent items from falling down while strengthened back boards and base board ensure a better load-bearing and stability, won't tilt or swing easily. Weights 55lbs, each shelves can support up to 25 lbs. 【COMPACT BOOK CASE & SPACE SAVING】 39.5\"L x 7.9\"W x 55\" H vertical structure, takes up a little space and allows this standing shelf to fit into small spaces, narrow corridors. It can be moved easily and placed everywhere. 【SUPER STURDY & EASY ASSEMBLE】Tree diagram design adds stability to shelf organizer. The enlarged base plate makes the standing bookshelf very stable even when it is not depending on the wall. Very simple structure, parts are easy to classify, instruction and hardware are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k0fzPorhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B083SQLJ48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083SQLJ48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083SQLJ48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":184412,"name":"Villeroy & Boch Switch 3 Decorated Rice Bowl, 25 oz, White/Colorful","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GZ72RAKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Bring Mediterranean flair to the table with switch 3: the elegant bowl with its round shape and floral elements is ideal for serving smaller dishes. In the delicate bowl, muesli with fresh fruit, as well as soups or desserts is tastefully arranged. This bowl is charmingly arranged Together with the dishes of the switch 3 series on the table. Since the switch 3 bowl is stackable inside each other and their edges are shock and impact resistant, they are also suitable for use when catering. Amazon.com The bright white background of the Switch 3 dinnerware pattern from Villeroy & Boch adds a fresh crispness to each piece. Deep blue leaf motifs repeat themselves throughout the collection, creating a strong central pattern, while a blue and white checked design adds a geometric counterbalance to the flowing structure of the leaves. Softer washes of color offset the boldness of the leaves, while a sponge-like effect tempers the bands of rich blue and green found around the rims and edges. Mix-and-match with Switch 3 Corfu, Switch 3 Castell, Switch 3 Cordoba, or Switch 3 Costa to create a truly unique collection. Perfect for serving cereal, ice cream, or a small meal, this 5-3/4 inch round bowl rests on a small base and stands 3 inches high. The crisp whiteness of the bowl showcases the blue leaf clusters as well as the soft band of green that trims the mouth of the vessel. Crafted from vitrified porcelain to ensure durability, all Villeroy & Boch tableware pieces are resilient enough to be placed in the dishwasher and microwave. For added beauty, a top glaze has been applied to protect the vivid colors. --Lea Werbel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GZ72RAKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B0000C8VK8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000C8VK8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000C8VK8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
