window.products.push({"id":184454,"name":"Fittia Satin Pillowcase King for Hair and Skin, Satin Pillow Cases for Women 2 Pack with Hidden Zipper, Pink, 20x36 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mt9X24yRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Satin Material: Fittia satin pillowcase is made of 100% high-quality satin. With a lustrous appearance and silky touch, satin pillow cover is considered a perfect choice for a great night’s sleep. Satin pillow cases are more sturdy and durable than silk pillowcase, which requires professional cares. Breathable & Cooling: Our satin pillow covers for hair can regulate your body temperature during your sleep. It naturally wicks away extra heat and moisture to keep your body cool all the time. Cooling pillow cases for hot sleepers, night sweat, and insomnia. No more toss and turns at night. Beautiful Hair and Skin: Sleeping on silky satin pillowcases is an overnight treatment for your hair and skin. Satin pillow cases for women present an anti-static and friction-free surface that helps your skin retain moisture and stay hydrated. It will not cause skin irritations of any kind. Best fit for sensitive skin. Hair experts also recommend satin pillowcase for protecting hair types prone to split ends, tangling, and breakage. Hidden Zipper Pillowcase: Smooth and durable zipper on the side is designed to hold your pillowcase securely in place all the time. Easy on and off, won’t get stuck when taking out. Prevent pillows from sliding out during your sweet dreams. Easy to Maintain: These satin pillowcases are machine washable. It is recommended to wash pillowcases on gentle cycle using cold water and mild detergent. Please do not bleach or dry clean. Hang dry in shade instead of tumble dry. Fittia satin pillowcase is wrinkle and fades resistant. Remain in good condition after each wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mt9X24yRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fittia","source_asin":"B09J7XP9YT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J7XP9YT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J7XP9YT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":184455,"name":"Zulay (60-80 inches) Giant Double Sided Tortilla Blanket - Novelty Big Tortilla Blanket for Adult and Kids - Premium Soft Flannel Round Tortilla Blank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EktDYPoES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE TASTIEST-LOOKING BLANKET: Have you ever wanted to be a human version of your favorite food? This realistically designed tortilla blanket has a double-sided print, making it look just like a yummy burrito. Your friends and family will surely want to get one for themselves when they see you wrapped up in this comfy burrito tortilla blanket. SOFT AND WARM MATERIAL: This cozy fleece blanket is perfect for all your snuggling needs! It is made from premium quality 280 GSM flannel, making it soft to touch, lightweight and breathable. The fabric is tightly stitched, making it durable for year-round use. Wrap yourself like a tortilla by the fireplace to watch a movie, or pack it up and use it as a travel blanket. It can also be used as a throw blanket, couch blanket, camping blanket, outdoor blanket, or a picnic blanket. A PERFECT FUNNY GIFT: Watch your loved ones face light up with joy after seeing a blanket that looks like a giant burrito! This fuzzy blanket makes a great Christmas gift, gag gift, white elephant gift for adults, or a birthday gift. Show your sense of humor by giving this cool gift to your foodie friend, sister, brother, children, mom or dad. It also makes an ideal pet blanket. EASY TO CARE FOR: Machine wash this round blanket on a gentle cycle with cold water, and tumble dry on low setting when needed. This throw is made from anti-fade and anti-shrink material, which will stay as good as new even after multiple washes. HASSLE-FREE, ZULAY GUARANTEE: We love and take pride in our food blanket and back it up with a lifetime guarantee. If, for any reason, it does not meet expectations, we got you covered. Chances are that this soft blanket will be your lifelong partner for staying cozy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EktDYPoES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B0BNQNGS8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQNGS8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQNGS8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
