window.products.push({"id":184459,"name":"Chesapeake Bay Candle New York Botanical Garden Gold Travel Tin Single Wick Candle, Verbena Basil (Pack of 6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tjkdc9yTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The new York botanical garden by Chesapeake Bay Candle gold travel tin single wick candle pack of 6 includes botanical scents and designs inspired by the grounds, architecture and rare illustrated works of the new York botanical garden. The Verbena basil (ocimum basilica) fragrance inspired by the herb garden. Fresh herbal scents of Verbena, grapefruit and tomato Leaf deliver a natural, soft aroma as we walk throughout the herb garden. Notes of tarragon, basil, red currant and rhubarb embrace the invigorating and uplifting atmosphere, resting on a bed of fresh pepper and green Moss. Includes Essential oils of basil, lemon and clary Sage. The top label is adorned with signature new York botanical garden archival illustration. With 5 fragrances available, the gold travel tin celebrates the exceptional beauty and unique artistry of the Garden's rare archival holdings and shares, through fragrance, the magnificent botanicals found in its diverse, living collections. The new York botanical garden (nybg) is an iconic living museum, a major educational institution and a scientific organization operating one of the world's largest plant Research and conservation programs. Integral to this initiative are the rare archival collections of the Garden's luster T. Mertz Library, which contain illustrated works dating back as far as the 12th century. Chesapeake Bay Candle has partnered with the new York botanical garden on a finely fragranced collection to celebrate the exceptional beauty and unique artistry of the Garden's rare archival holdings and to share with consumers, through fragrance, the magnificent botanicals found in its diverse living collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tjkdc9yTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chesapeake Bay Candle","source_asin":"B010B5QVRO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010B5QVRO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010B5QVRO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
