window.products.push({"id":184727,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner, Hommie 5 in 1 Personal Mini Air Cooler with 2 Fans, 8 Colors LED Light and 3 Speeds, Small Desk Mini Ac Evaporative Cooler F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71onaNhik0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️☢[4 IN 1 PORTABLE AIR COOLER FAN] Combined portable air conditioner cooler, desk fan, air humidifier and night light into this air cooler fan. Thanks to the latest evaporative cooling technology and the built-in filter, even if you directly add pure water or ice water into the water tank, the healthier, cooler mist will be come out the air outlet. Welcome a cooler and healthier breeze, say goodbye to the hot, dry air! ❄️[DUAL FANS & QUICKER COOLING] Two built-in fans, no blades exposed so not to hurt people and totally safe for kids or pets, plus 400ml Large water tank that lasts up to 6 hour working time on a full tank. All above these are designed to cool the hot air around you and share cool air in your space (Wind Volume up to 140m³/h), like bedroom, office and so on. NOTE: Can’t be as cold as air conditioner or make the room cool but much cooler than the fan and will not make you skin dry. ❄️[3 WIND SPEED & 60°/120° ADJUSTABLE AIR OUTLET] Features with 2 wind modes (Natural/Cold Wind) and 3 speed settings (Gentle/Medium/Strong), this adorable evaporative air cooler cools down the air around you instantly to the temperature you prefer. Manual up-down to adjust blowing direction in 60°/120°, which provides much wider cooling area, very convenient for you to share the coolness with your friends or families during parties, camping or other activities. ❄️[8 COLORS LIGHT & LOW NOISE] Personal air cooler comes with auto RGB light and always-on light, you can press LIGHT button to switch them. Place it at bedroom or living room to create a romantic atmosphere! What's more, the air cooler offers a clean and fresh mist at low noise (45-55dB), so it can also be used as night light for baby room nursery and kids or turn off it if not need. ❄️☢[PORTABLE, SAFE AND ENERGY SAVING] Compact size (5*5*9.8”) and 1.67lbs light weight, plus a portable handle design, you can effortlessly carry the air conditioner fan to where you want. Misting automatically shuts off when water runs out, much safer to use. Freon-free with less than 10W power consumption, a cost effective fan in preparation of the approaching summer. Note: Power input must be over 2A; or it may lead to insufficient wind volume. NO BATTERY STORAGE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71onaNhik0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hommie","source_asin":"B08T5SVNSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184727","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T5SVNSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T5SVNSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
