window.products.push({"id":184729,"name":"Boss Office Products Any Task Mid-Back Task Chair with Loop Arms in Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qUnkC0hYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mid-back styling with firm lumbar support. Elegant styling upholstered with commercial grade fabric. Sculptured seat cushion made from molded foam that contours to the shape of your body. Ratchet back height adjustment mechanism which allows perfect positioning of the back cushion and lumbar support. Standard loop arms. Large 27\" nylon base for greater stability. Pneumatic gas lift provides instant height adjustment of the seat. Adjustable tilt tension that accommodates all different size users. Hooded double wheel casters. Upright locking position. Available in four fabric colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qUnkC0hYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boss Office Products","source_asin":"B01N3SCNQJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N3SCNQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N3SCNQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":184730,"name":"Because Quarantine Stemless Wine Glass, Short Red Wine Glasses, Large Wine Glasses 18.5oz , Unique Social Distancing Wine Tumbler Gift Idea For Mom Da","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vqXcYyXaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Funny Social Distancing Gift: It will be a perfect, creative, and funny gift for friends. Being wording \"Because Quarantine\" on the funny wine glass. This idea comes from social distance theme. Even if we are far away, our hearts will stay close because of this gift. In the tough time, our enthusiasm will not cool down. Multi Application: Its humanized design is the design concept we pursue.This stemless wine glass design with 18.5oz big capacity which can hold multi beverage, like red or white wine, cocktails, juice, champagne, cabernet, pinot noir, whiskey, port, beer, yogurt, milk. We recommend wash them by hand, dishwasher are not recommended. Premium Materials: The women funny wine glass is made of nonlead glass with a crystal clear body. The advantage of our process is color of the cup is transparent and there is no impurities. When you would like to store drinks it can also better reflect the color of the drinks. While enjoying the drinks, we can also watch our drinks, so that we can drink the drinks with pleasure. Perfect for Anniversarie:: The friend funny wine glass was given to your sister, wife, mother, aunt, best friend, colleague, boss, grandmother, daughter or girlfriend with your best wishes. It could helps you on Christmas, New Year's Day, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and important anniversaries, to convey your sincere heart to him. Create Sweet Memories: Unconsciously, the cup has become a necessity for our daily use. On special days, we take out the glass cup and take a toast together. Talk to a friend for a long time, while drinking beverages, talking with him and enjoying a unforgetable time together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vqXcYyXaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfook","source_asin":"B09LHKGT5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LHKGT5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LHKGT5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":184731,"name":"Personalized Name Created with Black and White Architectural Alphabet Photographs Including 8 by 20 inch Frame for Personalized Gift, Wedding, Graduat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PthmNa1BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is \"Creative Letter Art\"? ******Creative - Creativity is something that comes from within ones soul, normally stimulated by Love or Heartbreak. ******Letter - Language that has many forms, from the beginning of man when using picture of things on Cave Walls (\"Hieroglyphics\") to the modern day letters we see today. ******Art - With a Creative Soul, being able to feel and see what others don't, a Vivid Imagination, the Obsession of capturing the Beauty of our Surroundings and bringing at all together in the form of Art. ******This is a new and descriptive way to describe what we spell. All photographs that make up a Creative Letter Art are Original, One Of A Kind and taken by Ethan Reiss. Each one has a unique and different description bringing each word and every name to life. See what theme best describes you or the person your giving it to. *******Architecture - Take a Cathedral, the Lintel of an Entrance or the Volute of a Column standing tall? To the average person they're overlooked but to me I see the beautiful soft textures of Stone providing just what's needed to bring Gabriella's name to life. Her Brother John on the other hand can only be described with Metal. The Bridge and Railing describe how Strong, rough around the edges and tuff he is along with his personality. When using both Stone, Metal and the perfect blend of colors for the Newlywed Smith's you add Elegance, Beauty and just enough Strength bringing them to life in a whole new way. Wouldn't this be the perfect gift for all Newlyweds? Your new Art will consist of the Original Themed Photographs described above, Custom Framed with a Signed and Dated Certificate with appropriate hardware making it ready to Hang. See for yourself why Creative Letter Art stands out. Be sure to visit our interactive website at Creativeletterart.net . We can be reached at ethan@creativeletterart.net or by phone 800-610-4180 - Thank You for Looking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PthmNa1BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Letter Art","source_asin":"B00LHVO32C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LHVO32C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LHVO32C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
