window.products.push({"id":184810,"name":"Valley Side Homes 16oz Drinking Glass Cups With Bamboo Lids and Straws set of 4 - Can Shaped Glass Cups, Iced Coffee Cup Glass Straw, Cocktail Tumbler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817zQEYZ0SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT'S IN THE PACKAGE: Beer cup glassware tumbler sets come with 4 glass beer can shaped mugs, 4 clear glass straws, 4 bamboo lids with a silicone ring to prevent spills, 2 cleaning brushes to keep your straws looking new after each use. Drinking glass cups with lids have been created from thick-high-quality crystal-clear glass to create long-lasting drinking glasses. Clear coffee cups are great with many cold drinks as matcha, tea, boba, wine and more! DURABLE AND SAFE: Each 16oz glass drinking cup set of 4 is created with durability in mind. Glass tumbler is crafted from BPA free-food grade material. Bamboo lids are smooth on their surface and include a silicone ring on each lid to prevent leakage or spills. Feel safe knowing the best materials have been carefully selected in the creation of these tumbler glass cups with lids and straws that are ready to be a part of your home matcha/coffee bar accessories. VERSATILE GLASS: These clear-thick can shaped beer glasses with lid and straw can be used in a variety of ways. Enjoy a morning iced coffee cup or a glass of juice as you start your day, a cold glass of milk, a cold smoothie drink, a cup of tea with ice or a simple glass of iced cold water. Tumblers with straw also make perfect coffee gifts for coffee lovers who are sure to enjoy their reusable coffee cups with lids. Glass coffee cups are a great addition to gatherings and as housewarming gifts for new home as well and much more. MAKE IT YOUR OWN: Customize glasses to make them your own. Perfect for DIY project without having to worry about the glass easily breaking. Add stickers, patterns, paint them to add your own personal touch. Drinking glasses with bamboo lids are ready to be personalized to please coffee/beer/cocktail/whiskey lovers as they make them a part of their everyday home bar essentials. Create unique designs on our clear glass tumbler cups to gift to coffee lover women in your life, friends and family. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: We pride ourselves in our product and customer satisfaction is top priority for us at Valley Side Homes. Soda can glasses, lids and glass straws will be shipped securely in a thick box with polyfoam, and heavy bubble wrap inside-packaging has been drop tested and is packaged to securely transport glass items and withstand transport. Once items are received, wash prior to use. If glasses/straws/lids you receive are damaged or you are not satisfied, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817zQEYZ0SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Valley Side Homes","source_asin":"B0BGCTQKQF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGCTQKQF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGCTQKQF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
