window.products.push({"id":184943,"name":"Mini Air Conditioner, TEMEIKE 3-IN-1 Personal Air Cooler, Fan/Cooling/Misting/7-Color Night Light, USB Rechargeable 4000mAh Battery, 100° Rotation, Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYytBoCTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❆【4000mAh Li-ion Battery for Wireless Use】Say goodbye to the hassle of frequent recharging with our 4000mAh battery-powered mini air conditioner. Just only charge it once for 2-4 hours and enjoy a whopping 4 hours of continuous high-speed fan operation. Our air cooler is perfect for outdoor activities like camping and picnics, keeping you cool and comfortable without breaking a sweat. So, ditch the heat and embrace the breeze with our portable air conditioners! ❆【8oz Top-refilled Water Tank for 3-Hour Cooling】Experience moisturizing air by adding ice cubes and water to our small portable air conditioner's 8 oz water tank. This not only prevents the constant wind from making you feel dry but also provides extra coolness. With just one fill, our portable ac air conditioner can deliver continuous cooling wind and humidification for up to 3 hours. Easy to clean and maintain. To avoid tilting the product after filling it with water to prevent any spills or leaks. ❆【Simple Control & Easy to Use】Controlling the temperature has never been easier with our small air conditioner user-friendly control buttons. With just a click, you can effortlessly switch between 3 wind speeds: low/medium/high, to create the perfect cooling experience. The battery indicator and charging status are clearly displayed, ensuring that you never run out of power unexpectedly. ❆【3-in-1 Functional Mini Air Conditioner】If you crave a cool summer breeze but don't want the expenditure of running an AC, try a functional and mini portable air conditioner instead. As a normal fan/cooling fan/misting fan/night light in one unit, perched on your nightstand or dresser, a portable air cooler fan directs the breeze right where you need it, making it the perfect addition to any room! ❆【7-Color Light, Create More Fun】Looking for a way to add some fun and excitement to your child's room? Our evaporative air cooler is the perfect solution! With 7 different colors to choose from, your child can enjoy a mesmerizing light show while staying cool and comfortable. The soft, gentle light is perfect for helping your little one drift off to sleep. ❆【USB Rechargeable Desktop Cooling Fan for Outdoor/Indoor Use】This air conditioner portable can be used in combination with adapters, mobile power supplies, computers, car chargers, etc. So even if you are outside, like camping or fishing, or picnic, you can enjoy the breeze when you feel the heat. Get a convenient and portable evaporative cooler aside from you, cool anywhere, anytime! ❆【Gift Option】Looking for a thoughtful gift that is both practical and unique? Our personal air cooler is a perfect choice! Not only can it help keep your loved ones cool and comfortable during hot summer days, but it's also easy to use and can be taken anywhere. Whether you're buying it for an elderly relative who needs a little extra comfort, or a child who loves colorful and fun gadgets, this versatile cooler fan is sure to be a hit. ❆【The Ultimate Desktop Companion】Don't let the heat interfere with your productivity. The portable ac is the perfect partner for your desk, designed for individual use without the need for any additional installation. With its compact size and user-friendly features, it delivers a cooling breeze to keep you cool and focused on even the hottest summer days. Enjoy cool air anytime, anywhere with TEMEIKE personal air conditioner. ❆【100° Wide Rotation & Adjustable Air Outlet】Experience the cooling power of our mini air cooler with its 100° wide rotation, which delivers a wider spread of cold air up to 33 square feet compared to standard fans that simply swing their vents. Moreover, the air outlet of our swamp cooler can be adjusted up and down by 25°, giving you more control over the direction of the cool air. Don't settle for a basic fan - upgrade to our premium model for the ultimate cooling experience! ❆【Ultra-Quiet Operation for Peaceful Sleep】Enjoy a peaceful and comfortable sleep with this portable air cooler, which operates at a low noise level of just 43 dB. The 60-second auto-off display ensures that you won't be disturbed during the night. Perfect for use in your bedroom, office, or study to create an optimal temperature and environment for restful sleep or focused work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYytBoCTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEMEIKE","source_asin":"B0C1RV4TY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-184943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1RV4TY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1RV4TY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
